  "details": "As it is, the option to set the microphone opacity separately from the rest of the HUD is great. One step further I'd like to go, however, is toggling opacity of each microphone *state* individually.\nGoing about my day normally talking with friends? I probably want to set the opacity of the \"not talking\" icon to 0%, so that the \"talking\" and \"muted\" icons are that much more noticeable. \nSleeping in VR with someone? I probably want to set the opacity of the \"muted\" icon to 0% so that the glaring red doesn't keep me up, but the \"talking\" and \"not talking\" icons still show to warn me that I haven't properly muted myself, or I've somehow unmuted.",
